[l_english.STATE_LORE_774]
The Storm Empire once swept across half the world and ended the centuries-old conflicts and chaos of the Anugypt desert — but unfortunately, this sudden “peace” did not benefit any living beings in the desert, as the tyranny and plundering of the Storm Empire brought down city-states and oases one after another.
But the center of the storm is precisely the calmest and most windless place. With the fall of the tyrant of the Storm Empire in Canterlot, Anugypt became the eye of the storm — a huge power vacuum formed in Anugypt, and those city-states whose names had been erased from the map reappeared. The guys who had fought with claws and blades inherited those empire spaceships and weapons that shocked the world. Every pony knew that what was coming next was going to be a total and ridiculous —
peace?
Under the guidance of Twilight Sparkle, the School of Friendship was established, and all races in the world were welcome to come to Ponyville to learn the true meaning of friendship. As one of the largest melting pots of species in the world, Anugypt experienced the sweetness of diversity for the first time instead of its poison. From moles to parrots, from cats to ponies, from wolves to griffons, from bison to fishmen, the representatives of Anugypt’s city-states gathered in the oasis at the center of the desert to establish a city-state called the “New Anugypt”. With the witness, guarantee, and arbitration of Canterlot, the city-states formed a league, held regular conferences to discuss affairs in the desert, and sent friendship ambassadors to other city-states to mediate disputes when necessary. The howling desert finally welcomed a long-lost calm. Oases bloomed again in the desert, trade flowed between city-states, and art, culture, and even algebra and geometry were revived in Anugypt. The weapons of war were no more, and the future of Anugypt was bright, with a prosperous golden age seemingly within reach.
And this is when their arbiter fell from the throne.

[l_simp_chinese.STATE_LORE_774]
风暴帝国曾一度席卷半个世界，也终结了安及沙漠千年来的纷争与混乱 — 只可惜这突如其来的“和平”并未让任何沙漠中的生灵享受到好处，风暴帝国的暴政与掠夺让安及的城邦与绿洲一个个倒下。
但风暴的最中心，恰恰是最平静无风的地方。随着风暴帝国的暴君在坎特洛特陨落，安及成为了风暴之眼 — 巨大的权力真空在安及形成，那些被从地图上抹去了名字的城邦重新出现，曾用爪子与利刃搏斗的家伙继承了那些震撼世界的帝国飞船与武器，任何小马都知道，随之而来的即将是彻底而又癫狂的——
和平？
在暮光闪闪的指导下，友谊学校设立，世界上的各个种族都被欢迎前往小马利亚学习友谊的真谛。安及做为几乎是世界最大的物种熔炉，第一次体会到了多样性带来的甜蜜而不是毒药。从鼹鼠到鹦鹉，从猫猫到小马，从豺狼到狮鹫，从野牛到鱼人，安及的城邦代表们齐聚沙漠中心的绿洲，建立了名为“新安及”的城邦。在坎特洛特的见证、担保与仲裁下，各个城邦组成了同盟，定期召开大会协商沙漠中的事务，并且在必要时派遣友谊大使前往其他城邦调解纷争。狂风不息的沙漠终于迎来了久违的平静。绿洲重新在沙漠中绽放，贸易重新在城邦间流动，艺术与文化，甚至代数与几何也在安及复兴。兵戈不再，安及的未来一片光明，似乎一个富庶繁荣的黄金时代已经近在眼前。
然后他们的仲裁就从王座上跌落了。
